UID:260107wSnZ-bISSEW1i5hHJ9ODKw
DESCRIPTION:Kelseyville Pear Festival Art Contest  CALL FOR ART FROM KELSE
 YVILLE 4th & 5th graders: Start practicing your designs now! The contest b
 egins the first week of school\, right at the height of our local pear har
 vest.  A representative of the Lake County Rural Arts Initiative will drop
  off entry forms to Kelseyville Elementary and Kelseyville Riviera schools
 . Finished artwork to be turned in at your school Friday\, September 19th 
 by 2pm. Pears are the theme but the rest is up to the artist. 11"x17" form
 at. There will be two 1st place winners \\(boy & girl\\) who will become t
 he Kelseyville Pear Festival Pear Prince & Pear Princess and will ride in 
 the parade!  Cash prizes for 1st - $100\, 2nd - $50\, & 3rd - $25 places! 
 \\*Submitted artwork may be used in Kelseyville Pear Festival and/or Kelse
 yville Business Association artwork.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/668181079531833/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
