 oon of spirits and cocktails.    The experience begins with a guided tasti
 ng of three spirits while learning about the Humboldt County distillery an
 d its small-batch approach. A master mixologist then demonstrates how to c
 reate three signature cocktails\, sharing techniques and tips as each drin
 k is prepared and served.    After the tasting and cocktail session\, gues
 ts can relax with an included picnic lunch from Market on Town Square. Par
 ticipants will also receive two complimentary Humboldt Distillery tastings
  to enjoy at a future date and have the opportunity to enter a raffle.
