UID:260820BQZDYX-LT0eSBzfFNa3rqg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive discussion with Greg Tranah\, Ph.D.
 \, as we explore the science of healthy aging\, longevity\, strength\, cog
 nition\, movement and vitality.\n\nAs Professor of Epidemiology and Biosta
 tistics at UCSF and Director of Precision Medicine at Sutter Health\, Dr T
 ranah will share evidence-based insights on how our bodies change over tim
 e - and what we can do to enjoy a higher quality of life at every age.\n\n
 Stay after the talk to meet Dr. Tranah and enjoy free coffee\, tea and sna
 cks at The Kove.
LOCATION:The Kove community hub
