SUMMARY:Opening Day Celebration: Día de los Muertos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T170000
UID:260826b6DAJIP6nUm6ZQJbw44WcA
DESCRIPTION:**Celebrate the opening of the Museum of Sonoma County's 30th 
 annual Día de los Muertos exhibition! Explore beautifully crafted ofrenda
 s created by local artists and community members honoring the lives and me
 mories of loved ones. Throughout the day\, enjoy family-friendly art activ
 ities from 11:00 am–2:00 pm\, including papel picado\, paper flowers\, s
 kull mask making\, and more.El Día de los Muertos\, or Day of the Dead\, 
 is celebrated throughout Mexico\, many Central and South American countrie
 s\, and within communities across the United States. Rooted in ancient tra
 ditions\, it is a joyful celebration of the cycle of life that honors the 
 memories of family members and loved ones who have passed away.Join us for
  a day of art\, creativity\, and community as we kick off this beloved ann
 ual tradition.**
LOCATION:Museums of Sonoma County
URL:https://tickets.museumsc.org/?tab=Events&view_date=&period=Weekly&mode
 =Event&event=1783708477280x114722688847314940
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
