X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://safariwest.com/calendar/safari-west-presents-educator-galen/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Safari West Presents! Educator Galen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T203000
UID:260131dJA1vwXdh0-zOyHYB4phkQ
DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series:  Galen joins us in the elephant ro
 om after dinner to give a talk about Sonoma County Wildlife. The conservat
 ion dinner series is complimentary to all dinner guests. If you would like
  to just go to this presentation\, please call our reservations team at \\
 (707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695 and they can book it for you. Dinne
 r starts at 7:00 PM.    About the Speaker My name is Galen. I have been in
 terested in nature my whole life. For the last ten years snakes have been 
 my favorite animals. I have been finding and studying snakes and other ani
 mals for over ten years now. I volunteered at the Petaluma Wildlife Museum
  for two years and I was an Enviroleader with the Sonoma Ecology Center fo
 r three years. For the last three years I have been giving presentations a
 nd leading nature walks in Sonoma County. I am currently studying at the J
 unior College. I have a strong passion for teaching people about these ama
 zing animals!
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://safariwest.com/calendar/safari-west-presents-educator-galen/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
