 -night vibe you’ve been craving—fun\, loose\, and full of energy.\n\nW
 ith free popcorn\, great drinks\, and a room buzzing from the comedy show 
 before it\, Saturday’s karaoke party is the perfect way to cap off your 
 night. Come sing\, dance\, laugh\, and let it all out at Barrel Proof Loun
 ge.\n\n21+ 501 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Rosa Check out\n\n**www.B
 arrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
