DESCRIPTION:https://www.thevagabondempire.com\n\nVagabond Empire is an exp
 ansive new solo project for acoustic guitar\, banjo\, vocals\, and whateve
 r other sounds -- and guest players -- find their way into the mix.\n\nBor
 n from the ashes of critically acclaimed "bluevelvetgrass" string band Thr
 ee Times Bad\, Vagabond Empire's genre-expansive set list combines America
 na classics with dynamic originals from three song collections: Singalongs
  for End Times\, After the Plague\, and American Sojourn.\n\nThe music dig
 s deep into 100\\+ years of American roots traditions\, from Tin Pan Alley
  and early jazz\, to swing\, folk\, blues\, bluegrass\, country\, honkyton
 k\, and more.
LOCATION:Woodacre Residency (end date)
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108362774?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
