X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sundays in Sonoma at Viansa Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T000000
UID:260624tdKHRKVdIUWQMuLln2PPGA
DESCRIPTION:Viansa Winery feels made for live music\, perched atop the Sum
 mit of Sonoma with sweeping vineyard views and Tuscan-inspired charm. This
  summer and fall\, acclaimed singer-songwriter Greg Lamboy brings his warm
 \, intimate sound to the hilltop terrace for select afternoon performances
  as part of Viansa's outdoor music series. An award-winning guitarist and 
 frontman of the Americana band Pacific Standard\, Lamboy is known for pitc
 h-perfect melodies and deeply personal lyrics. His relaxed\, soulful style
  pairs effortlessly with Viansa's panoramic setting\, estate wines\, and l
 aid-back elegance. Settle in with a tasting\, take in the views\, and enjo
 y an afternoon where strong vocals\, masterful guitar\, and unforgettable 
 songs rise above the everyday. Performance Dates: June 14\, June 21\, July
  12\, July 19\, July 26\, October 4\, and October 18 from 12 pm -3 pm.
LOCATION:Viansa Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/culinary-garden-cooking-classes-at-quivira-vineyards/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Culinary Garden Cooking Classes at Quivira Vineyards
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260906T000000
UID:260904s0Ajg1KGAEyhaeu9E-So9g
DESCRIPTION:Join an immersive\, hands-on culinary series at Quivira Vineya
 rds\, offered June 7-November 15 from 11 AM - 2 PM. Led by Estate Chef Jul
 ia\, guests begin in the organic estate garden harvesting seasonal ingredi
 ents before moving to the open-air kitchen to prepare a garden-inspired\, 
 multi-course meal. This interactive experience highlights the connection b
 etween garden\, vineyard\, and kitchen\, while teaching practical culinary
  techniques. The evening concludes with a shared meal paired with Quivira 
 wines in a beautiful estate setting. Each date features a different focus\
 , including handmade pasta\, masa and tacos\, stuffed pasta\, global dumpl
 ings\, and seasonal pie baking. Space is limited for these unique seasonal
  classes.
LOCATION:Quivira Vineyards and Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/culinary-garden-cooking-classes-at-quivir
 a-vineyards/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
