DESCRIPTION:Summer Sundays at DeLoach Vineyards offer a relaxing way to en
 joy wine country with live music\, featured food vendors\, and scenic vine
 yard views. Sip wines by the glass or bottle\, cool off with wine slushies
 \, or enjoy refreshing cocktails while taking in the beautiful surrounding
 s. Bring the whole family for an afternoon of lawn games\, good food\, mus
