DESCRIPTION:Come and join us at our winery on Mare Island for a fun-filled
  afternoon of live music and wine. We are thrilled to have the popular SF 
 Bay Area band\, 3day Weekend\, performing on our outdoor stage from 1pm to
  4pm. Get ready to groove and dance to their amazing selection of Motown\,
  R&B\, Classic Rock\, and Funk hits. Sip on our award-winning wines while 
 enjoying the beautiful scenery and great music. This event is perfect for 
 families\, friends\, and music lovers. Food: Lasagna con Amore - Chef Mass
 imo from Italy and wife Sonia\, will be serving sumptuous Lasagna Bolognes
 e and tantalizing Lasagna Pesto\, along with Italian Meatballs in marinara
  sauce\, caprese salad\, and authentic Italian desserts. Misc: Gate opens 
 at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are free. Well mannered and ma
 naged puppy dogs allowed in our outdoor venue. We will have seating for ev
 eryone.  Your own comfy folding chairs are welcome. \\*You may bring your 
 own water and "light snacks." \\*\\*NO large catering trays\, chafing dish
 es\, tables\, or other large party supplies allowed. Must coordinate celeb
 rations with venue. info@vinogodfather.com NO outside alcohol of any kind!
  TICKETS ARE $17 Advance TICKETS ARE $22 Day of Show
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Winery
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1683925426667848/
