DESCRIPTION:Bootleg Rose is an indie folk duo with Hannah Rose and Tait Sa
 rter\, known for their soulstirring harmonies\, acoustic driven sound\, an
 d emotive songwriting. Based in Eugene\, Oregon\, the duo returns to HopMo
 nk Sebastopol for a special night of music\, with local bassist\, Tim Sart
 er joining them on stage.\n\nTheir music blends genres of folk\, Americana
 \, and blues into songs that feel both familiar and fresh\, anchored in tr
 adition but unafraid to explore new territory. Known for their dynamic liv
 e performances and vocal chemistry\, Bootleg Rose has become a beloved act
 \, returning to their California roots annually.\n\nFree & all ages event.
