SUMMARY: Introduction to SoulCollage
DESCRIPTION:\nPresenter: Karen Haas\nSunday\, September 6th\n1:00PM-3:30P
 M\n$25.00 (Includes All Supplies)\nLocation: Santa Rosa\n\nSoulCollage® i
 s part creative exploration and part self-discovery. It’s fun and can be 
 delightfully surprising! Participants will explore the process of collage
  making using magazines images on 5” x 8” canvas\, usually cut from mat b
 oard or other stiff paper. Collage allows everyone to be an artist\, even
  if you don’t believe you have a creative bone in your body\, because you
  are working with found images. In this Introductory class you will also 
 explore the intuitive process of "listening" to the wisdom of the collage
  you completed\, using images that you were drawn to. If one decides to k
 eep making these 5”x 8” cards\, you eventually have your own personally m
 ade oracle deck that can offer you insights and guidance from deep soul w
 isdom.\n\nYou’ll then learn how to “read” your card as it\nshares its dee
 per meaning\, offering insights and guidance. www.artofpresence.net http:
 //www.artofpresence.net/\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contac
 t Karen at: 707-494-2205 by call or text\nor please email her at: karen@a
 rtofpresence.net mailto:karen@artofpresence.net\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Collage
