DESCRIPTION:The table is set for something new at the Village.\n\nJoin us 
 on Wednesday\, September 9 as we celebrate the grand opening of Great Comp
 any\, a locally owned dinner party shop bringing a thoughtful selection of
  home goods\, serve ware and conversation-starting details to Montgomery V
 illage.\n\nBorn from the founders of Reed & James Events\, Great Company i
 s a natural extension of their love for hosting and bringing people togeth
 er. The shop was inspired by a simple belief that life’s best moments ha
 ppen around the table\, where good food\, thoughtful touches and great com
 pany come together. From intimate dinners to lively celebrations\, Great C
 ompany makes it easier to gather\, celebrate and build community.\n\nCome 
 celebrate with complimentary goodies\, a special pop-up from L’Occitane 
 and more surprises throughout the day.
LOCATION:Great Company\, Montgomery Village
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/great-company-grand-opening-cele
 bration/
