DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T183000
UID:260828KAsl8a-xL0WbeoSgtHedJQ
DESCRIPTION:Ocean: Fragile Beauty\, a group exhibition celebrating the sea
  and raising awareness for ocean and whale conservation.\n\nMy pieces tran
 slate whale vocalizations and spectrograms into visual art\, working from 
 the idea that sound is to whales what sight is to us. They hang alongside 
 work by Patricia Hewett\, Brian Nelson\, Julia Pozsgai\, and Brian Rucker.
 \n\nDate: Wednesday\, September 9\, 5:00 to 6:30pm\n\nAddress: Vintage Hou
 se in Sonoma\n\nVintage House\, 264 First Street East Sonoma\n\nOn view Se
 ptember 1 to 25\, Monday to Friday\, 9am to 4pm\n\nCo-sponsored by the Art
 s Guild of Sonoma\n\nA portion of every sale supports BayQuest’s ocean c
 onservation work
LOCATION:Vintage House in Sonoma
URL:https://orangeorca.art/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
