DESCRIPTION:September 8 — Wine Dinner | Springfield\, IL\n\nThe Corkscre
 w | 5:30–9 PM \n\nJoin Gundlach Bundschu at The Corkscrew for a special 
 evening of Sonoma wine\, food\, and storytelling. Taste through a selectio
 n of wines from our historic Rhinefarm estate while exploring the vineyard
