BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Apa Pool League": "https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316208231/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_apa_pool_league
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316208231@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041948Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T220000
SUMMARY:APA Pool League - New Session Starting
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nJoin us for a thrilling APA Pool League Game 
 Night where we come together to showcase our skills in billiards and pool.
  Whether you're a seasoned player or a beginner looking to learn the ropes
 \, this event is perfect for pool enthusiasts of all levels. Test your str
 ategy\, improve your game\, and enjoy a friendly competition with fellow m
 embers of the APA Pool League. If you are looking for a fun night out to h
 ave fun\, meet people\, and play pool. Sonoma County APA is perfect for yo
 u. You don't have to be a pool shark to join. Beginners wanted. We are the
  worlds largest pool league and a fun league that competes once a week. Te
 ams that win\, will receive a fully paid trip to Las Vegas to compete in t
 he World Pool Championships. You can either join an existing team or creat
 e your own. Creating a team is very easy. You can grab 2 friends and have 
 them bring 2 of their friends. Friends\, co-workers\, or family. Everyone 
 can play and anyone can win. 5-8 players on a team. If you cant create a t
 eam\, come join an existing team. We have divisions that play on Tuesday\,
  Wednesday\, or Thursday nights. If you need more information\, please rea
 ch out to me. 707-687-8757 (Max)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316208231/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260821T023509Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260821T023509Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group": "https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-group/events/316038145/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_the_santa_rosa_spiritual_experiences_group
X-SOURCE:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group
UID:event_316038145@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041949Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260909T200000
SUMMARY:Living the Spiritual Life—Spiritual Parenting Chat
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Are your days fi
 lled with school\, sports\, clubs\, playdates?**\n\n**Is it sometimes chal
 lenging to find time for warm\, joyful connections in the family?**\n\n**W
 ould you like to discover ways to encourage your child to incorporate**\n*
 *their spiritual goals into all their activities?**\n\n**You are warmly in
 vited to come share your stories!**\n“An unselfish dream\, goal\, or ser
 vice can help us to the height of spiritual living.”\n—Harold Klemp\, 
 *The Spiritual Life\,* p. 117\n\n***Explore. . .***\n\n* Sharing tips to i
 mbue our family moments with joy\, playfulness\, and laughter.\n* Finding 
 ways to help keep precious family time as quality time.\n* Spiritual tools
  for the whole family.\n\n**Are you looking for ways to bring more spiritu
 ality**\n**into your life and the life of your family?**\n\nWe will be sha
 ring experiences of being a parent and acknowledging and recognizing our o
 wn inner knowing.\nIt is exciting to share stories and experiences with li
 ke-minded parents. By sharing\, our own inner wisdom can be strengthened a
 nd validated.\nParent discussions offer family-friendly tools in a relaxed
  setting for exploring spiritual truths and how we live them.\nYou're warm
 ly invited to share spiritual insights\, stories\, and experiences\, ask q
 uestions\, or simply listen.\n\n**Parents\, grandparents\, and friends are
  always welcome.**\n\nClick **[HERE](http://www.eckankar.org/explore/paren
 ts-families/)** to learn about spiritual opportunities for parents and fam
 ilies:\n\nClick **[HERE](https://www.adventuresineckparenting.org/se-1/)**
  to read about how family classes or “satsangs” can strengthen your fa
 mily’s spiritual connection.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-
 group/events/316038145/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260809T002102Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260809T002102Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
