DESCRIPTION:The 11th Annual Believe in the Dream – Lasso the Dream Gala
  will take place on September 10\, 2026\, from 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM at th
 e Luther Burbank Center for the Arts in Santa Rosa.\n\nJoin us for an in
 spiring evening celebrating 11 years of impact\, growth\, and student succ
 ess made possible through The LIME Foundation’s initiatives.\n\nThis y
 ear’s event will honor the accomplishments of NextGen Trades Academy gra
 duates and recognize the Shining Star Award recipient.\n\nGuests can look 
 forward to a meaningful program featuring live entertainment\, special mom
 ents of recognition\, and opportunities to support our mission. The evenin
 g will conclude with a lively after-party celebration.\n\nTickets and spon
 sorship opportunities are available at www.BelieveLIME.com.\n\nThis signa
 ture fundraising event brings the community together to celebrate mileston
 es and invest in the future of our communities.
