SUMMARY:The Social Contractors Live @ Aqus Cafe!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T200000
UID:260904SFht6vGg8k-n9BFAGwqFgw
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors as they return to rock Aqu
 s Cafe with an evening of upbeat original rock and their own spin on class
 ic hits you know and love \\(e.g. Beatles\, CCR\, Hendrix\, Doors\, Pink F
 loyd\, Police\, Men At Work\, U2\, Tears for Fears\, and more\\).\n\nThe S
 ocial Contractors lineup for this free live performance features band foun
 der and songwriter\, Jason E Davies \\(lead vocals\, lead/rhythm guitar\\)
 \, Travis Thayer \\(sax/keys/vocals\\)\, Rob Neidel \\(bass\\)\, and Chris
  Oatman \\(drums\\).\n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, searing guitar a
 nd sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or just great dynam
 ic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't disappoint.\n\nAqu
 s Cafe stands out because it's much more than a typical cafe. It's known a
 s a community hub\, hosting various events like poetry readings\, music\, 
 community dinners\, knitting circles\, conversation cafes\, and art exhibi
 tions.
LOCATION:Aqus Cafe
URL:https://www.aquscommunity.org/event/__trashed-5/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
