X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Origins: Choral Re-imaginings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260911T210000
UID:260810ssbAOkCBd0uwxkogIjLi3Q
DESCRIPTION:Join Aeternum\, California's professional chamber choir\, for 
 a concert and wine reception in the Clos Pegase wine caves. Origins explor
 es the Renaissance’s greatest hits like Allegri’s Miserere\, Byrd’s 
 Mass for Five\, and more\, alongside their re-imagined works by today’s 
 most exciting living composers. \n\nProgram:\n\nHildegard von Bingen — 
 Ave generosa\n\nWilliam Byrd — Ave verum corpus\n\nRoderick Williams —
  Ave verum corpus Re-imagined\n\nWilliam Byrd — Kyrie from Mass for Five
  Voices\n\nRoxanna Panufnik — Kyrie After Byrd\n\nGregorio Allegri — M
 iserere mei\, Deus\n\nJames MacMillan — Miserere\n\n-Interval-\n\nWillia
 m Byrd — Ne irascaris\n\nNico Mulhy — Fallings\n\nGiovanni Pierluigi d
 a Palestrina — Stabat mater\n\nKerensa Briggs — Stabat mater\n\nMargar
 et Rizza — Ave generosa
LOCATION:Clos Pegase Wine Caves
URL:https://www.aeternumchoir.org/buy-tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
