 rating the rich traditions and exciting future of American roots music on 
 Friday\, September 11\, 2026\, from 7:00–9:00 p.m. at the Sebastopol Com
 munity Cultural Center\, 390 Morris Street\, Sebastopol. Proceeds from the
  concert support Walker Creek Music Camp’s mission to provide world-clas
 s music education and access to traditional American roots music for stude
 nts of all ages. Audience members can look forward to an inspiring evening
  of live music featuring celebrated WCMC faculty alumni showcasing bluegra
 ss\, old-time\, jazz\, swing and other forms of American roots music. Perf
 orming artists: Crying Uncle Bluegrass Band – Evie Ladin Band – Pacifi
 c Drive Crying Uncle Bluegrass Band – Widely recognized as one of the mo
 st exciting young bands in acoustic music\, Crying Uncle Bluegrass Band bl
