 and we're stacking the deck. Guest host Martin Marrufo takes the mic\, kee
 ping the night moving with his smooth delivery and sneaky punchlines. Then
  it's wall-to-wall stand-up from Patrick Fishman\, Tramane Webb\, and Nata
 lie Diaz - three comics who know how to light up a room and leave it laugh
 ing. Details: Barrel Brothers Brewing Kitchen & Cocktails - Windsor\, CA D
 oors 7 PM |  Show 8-10 PM Last month packed the house. This one will too. 
 Grab tickets now at barrelbrothersbrewing.com or in the taproom before the
 y're gone. Comedy\, cold beer & cocktails\, and two hours you won't regret
  - unless you wait too long to get your spot.
