 al Creatures from the Workshop of Jacobo and María Ángeles*** features 
 brightly colored\, richly patterned sculptures depicting imaginary hybrid 
 animals that serve as spirit guides and astrological embodiments of human 
 character. Inspired by the Zapotec calendar\, the exhibition includes eigh
 t large-scale works organized by Denver Botanic Gardens.
