SUMMARY:Watercolor Painting Workshop at Made Local Marketplace
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T130000
UID:2608110JFTzXJkAUmQj3Vo795rhg
DESCRIPTION:Advance registration required\n\nSaturday\, September | 11:00a
 m–1:00pm\n\nJoin us at Made Local Marketplace in Montgomery Village for 
 a hands-on workshop led by local artist Irina Miller.\n\nWatercolor Paint
 ing: Cat in Pumpkin \\(Family-Friendly\\)\n\nGet into the Fall spirit as y
 ou paint an adorable cat popping out of pumpkin. This fun and relaxing cla
 ss will introduce a variety of watercolor techniques through step-by-step 
 instruction\, making it perfect for beginners and families alike.\n\nIn th
 is workshop\, you will:\n\n• Learn a variety of watercolor techniques\n\
 n• Follow guided\, step-by-step instruction\n\n• Complete a finished p
 ainting to take home\n\nNo experience is necessary. Recommended for ages 
 7 and up.\n\nAll materials and tools are provided.\n\nDetails:\n\n• $45 
 per person\n\n• Max 20 participants\n\n• Duration: 2 hours\n\nImportan
 t Notes:\n\n• Advance registration required\n\n• Workshops require a m
 inimum of 4 participants\n\n• 72 hours notice required for a partial ref
 und\n\n• Workshops are held outdoors\, under cover\, at Made Local Marke
 tplace in Montgomery Village
LOCATION:Made Local Marketplace
URL:https://www.madelocalmarketplace.com/product/987-watercolor-painting-f
 all-cat-in-pumpkin/36NVPHZQ3A3COPNZ37Z5HJLK
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
