BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.stgeorgerp.org/festival", "Press Democrat": "https://www.stgeorgerp.org/festival"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.stgeorgerp.org/festival"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:17th Annual Greek & Middle Eastern Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T200000
UID:260830NtvaR7o6lUelAOgqDJs5lA
DESCRIPTION:A Taste of Greece & the Middle East Comes to Rohnert Park!\n\n
 Get ready for a weekend filled with delicious food\, live music\, dancing
 \, culture\, and community! \n\nThe 17th Annual Greek & Middle Eastern F
 estival returns to Rohnert Park on Saturday\, September 12\, and Sunday\
 , September 13\, 2026\, from Noon–8 PM at St. George Orthodox Church.\
 n\nCome hungry and enjoy an incredible selection of authentic Greek and Mi
 ddle Eastern favorites\, including gyros\, shawarma\, falafel\, hummus\, 
 kabobs\, baklava\, knafeh\, loukoumades\, and more! 😋\n\nBut there’s
  much more than great food!\n\n🎶 LIVE MUSIC & ENTERTAINMENT • Alan G
 eorge — Live Saturday • Helios Greek Band — Live Sunday • Flowers 
 of the Nile Band — Sunday\, 5–7 PM\n\n💃 Traditional music\, dancin
 g & cultural performances 🛍️ International Marketplace & boutiques 
 🎨 Henna and family-friendly activities 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Fun 
 for the whole family 🚗 FREE ADMISSION & FREE PARKING\n\nWhether you’
 re celebrating your Greek or Middle Eastern heritage\, discovering these c
 ultures for the first time\, or simply looking for a great weekend outing\
 , come EAT. DRINK. DANCE. CELEBRATE!\n\n📅 Saturday & Sunday\, Septemb
 er 12–13\, 2026 ⏰ Noon–8 PM both days 📍 St. George Orthodox Chu
 rch 7311 College View Dr.\, Rohnert Park\, CA 94928 🎟️ FREE ADMISSIO
 N • FREE PARKING\n\nBring your family and friends and experience a vibra
 nt weekend of food\, music\, culture\, and community under the Sonoma Cou
 nty sun!\n\nFor more information: 🌐 stgeorgerp.org/festival\n\n\\#StGe
 orgeFestivalRP \\#GreekFestival \\#MiddleEasternFestival \\#RohnertPark \\
 #SonomaCounty \\#GreekFood \\#MiddleEasternFood \\#LiveMusic \\#FamilyFun 
 \\#ThingsToDoInSonomaCounty \\#FreeEvent
LOCATION:St. George Orthodox Church
URL:https://www.stgeorgerp.org/festival
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
