SUMMARY:Petaluma Rotary Clubs to Host 12th Annual Petaluma River Craft Bee
 r Festival Sept. 12
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T170000
UID:260902FXj1PTDadUafVgwKqjCXmA
DESCRIPTION:The Rotary clubs of Petaluma Valley and Petaluma Sunrise will 
 host the 12th annual Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival on Saturday\, Sept
 . 12\, from 1 to 5 p.m. along the Petaluma riverfront in historic downtown
  Petaluma.\n\nThe festival will feature craft beer tastings from two dozen
  regional breweries\, food from several of Petaluma’s popular restaurant
 s and live music from local bands.\n\nProceeds from the annual community f
 undraiser support local nonprofit programs benefiting Petaluma schoolchild
 ren\, isolated seniors and people experiencing homelessness\, as well as p
 rojects that protect and enhance the Petaluma River.\n\nEvent details\n\nW
 hat: 12th Annual Petaluma River Craft Beer Festival When: Saturday\, Sept.
  12\, from 1 to 5 p.m. Where: Downtown Petaluma riverfront at Water Street
  and Western Avenue Admission: $60 in advance or $65 on the day of the eve
 nt\, if tickets remain
LOCATION:Downtown Petaluma Riverfront at Water Street and Western Avenue
URL:http://petalumarivercraftbeerfest.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
