 ackyard party to Vallejo\, and you do not want to miss it! THE MUSICThe in
 credible Soul’d Out Band will be taking the stage\, keeping you on your 
 feet all afternoon. Get ready to dance and sing along to your favorite R&B
  and Top 40 hits! From classic grooves to modern anthems\, they are bringi
