UID:260829ZzCOLWkki0qtjdGSnQ2gwA
DESCRIPTION:**H&L Live: Vernon "Ice" Black Trio**\n\nVernon “Ice” Blac
 k is a legendary Bay Area-based session guitarist\, producer\, composer\, 
 and musical director whose work has helped shape modern soul\, R&B\, and p
 op. Throughout his career\, he has recorded and toured with icons includin
 g Mariah Carey\, Herbie Hancock\, Whitney Houston\, and Stevie Wonder\, br
 inging world-class musicianship and unmistakable groove to every stage he 
 plays.\n\n🍷 **Wine Club Perk:** Up to 4 member guests receive a complim
 entary glass of Chill Red or Estate Sauvignon Blanc on arrival.\n\n‍**Wh
 at to Know:**\n\n**Admission is free** - just show up and enjoy\n\n**Outdo
 or seating** - lawn and picnic area available (bring blankets encouraged)\
 n\n**All ages welcome** - family-friendly event\n\n**Wine available** for 
 purchase by the glass or bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live at its best: world-cla
 ss musicians\, golden hour timing\, and the Russian River Valley as your b
 ackdrop. Come early\, stay late\, and experience why the North Bay music s
 cene is legendary.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-vernon-ice-black-tri
 o
