SUMMARY:ARTIST RECEPTION FEATURING BOBBIE BURGERS: DEPTH OF FIELD
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T180000
UID:260817GpOsK7skkEmoKh2O4Wif6A
DESCRIPTION:**Saturday\, September 12\, 2026 | 4:00–6:00 PM** **Caldwell
  Snyder Gallery | 1328 Main Street\, St. Helena\, CA**\n\nCaldwell Snyder 
 Gallery is pleased to present **Depth of Field**\, a solo exhibition of ne
 w works by acclaimed Canadian artist **Bobbie Burgers**. Join us on **Satu
 rday\, September 12\, from 4–6 PM** for a Conversation with the Artist &
  Book Signing celebrating the exhibition.\n\nFor more than two decades\, B
 urgers has developed a distinctive contemporary painting practice defined 
 by vibrant color\, expressive gesture\, and richly layered surfaces. Blurr
 ing the line between abstraction and representation\, her paintings transf
 orm florals and organic forms into immersive compositions inspired by the 
 rhythms\, growth\, and fleeting beauty of the natural world.\n\nBorn in Va
 ncouver\, British Columbia\, Burgers has exhibited extensively throughout 
 Canada\, the United States\, Europe\, and China. Caldwell Snyder Gallery h
 as proudly represented the artist since 2002.\n\n**Depth of Field will be 
 on view through September 30\, 2026.**\n\n**Event Details:** Saturday\, Se
 ptember 12\, 2026 4:00–6:00 PM Caldwell Snyder Gallery 1328 Main Street 
 St. Helena\, CA 94574\n\nFree and open to the public.
LOCATION:Caldwell Snyder Gallery 
URL:https://www.caldwellsnyder.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
