SUMMARY:Opening Reception: Illumination in Glass
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T200000
UID:260902NBGj_7CPhkGF1i4Kj6tGJA
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning mosaic artist\, actress\, and beauty queen Maria
  Isabel Lopez invites the public to experience Illumination in Glass\, a s
 olo exhibition at Usher Gallery celebrating the transformative power of li
 ght\, color\, and the human spirit through contemporary mosaic art.\n\nKno
 wn internationally for her accomplishments in film\, the arts\, and public
  service\, Lopez brings the same passion and creativity that distinguished
  her career as an actress and beauty queen to her work as a visual artist.
 \n\nJoin us at the opening reception on September 12th from 5pm to 8pm for
  an opportunity to meet Maria Isabel Lopez\, groove to live tunes by Zenia
  Avila\, and enjoy local refreshments. \n\nThrough luminous mosaics craft
 ed from stained glass\, natural stone\, and mixed media\, she transforms t
 housands of individual fragments into powerful works that explore faith\, 
 resilience\, cultural heritage\, nature\, and hope.
LOCATION:Usher Gallery
URL:https://ushergallerypetaluma.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
