DESCRIPTION:The Rotary Club of Ignacio proudly presents the 5th Annual BBQ
 \, Brews\, and Comedy night\, Saturday\, September 12\, 5:30 PM\, at the J
 onas Center\, IVC Marin campus\,1800 Ignacio Blvd in Novato. Enjoy dinner\
 , beverages\, auctions\, and performances by highly popular Bay Area comic
 s Shawn Felipe\, reigning champion of the 2025 San Francisco International
  Comedy Competition\, Clara Bijl\, who has performed for over 30 years acr
 oss the US and Europe\, and Samson Koletkar\, the world’s only Indian Je
 wish stand-up comedian who has toured three continents and featured on NPR
