SUMMARY:A Toast to our Heroes: A Wine & Culinary Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T180000
UID:260902kQ14GwYuGEKJHqqtJ9jshw
DESCRIPTION:Sip\, Savor\, and Support Current & Future Female Heroes\n\nPl
 ease join us for a special Dinner at Sentivo Vineyards\, a winery owned by
  Medic Ambulance of Solano County. This family-owned business is dedicated
  to supporting our mission of providing women and girls with access to th
 e education and training they need to achieve economic empowerment. At th
 is year's winemakers' dinner\, we will celebrate our female First Responde
 rs and the future leaders that your generous donations will support.\n\nTh
 anks to our supporters' contributions last year\, SI Vallejo has provided 
 the following to our community this year:\n\n$20\,000 to our Live Your Dre
 am Awardees\n\n$75\,000 to our High School Scholarship Awardees\n\nA Toast
  to our Heroes includes a multi-course dinner paired with select wines fro
 m Sentivo Vineyards. A vegetarian dinner option will be available. The eve
 ning also features our silent and live auctions- you'll be sure to find so
 mething special to take home. Let's pour love and support into the future
  of Vallejo's women and girls. All proceeds from this dinner go directly t
 owards funding the mission of Soroptimist International of Vallejo.
LOCATION:Sentivo Vineyards
URL:https://www.vallejosoroptimist.org/page/3930038-a-toast-to-our-heroes
