DTSTAMP:20260905T041944Z
UID:5scld26vh1mng600kggp8b99sc@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20250916T005758Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for an unforgettable evening of stargazing\, explor
 ation\, and cozy treats at Cosmos and Cocoa! This event brings together th
 e wonders of the cosmos with a warm cup of cocoa.</p><p>Kick off the night
  with a short\, guided hike along a portion our captivating Planet Walk\, 
 where you&#39\;ll encounter scale models of many of our solar system’s p
 lanets\, each with its own unique story. As the stars begin to sparkle\, w
 e’ll gather for an in-depth stargazing and storytelling session led by e
 xperienced astronomers who’ll point out constellations\, planets\, and c
 elestial objects. </p><p>The event’s highlight is telescope viewing thr
 ough our powerful observatory telescopes\, providing a chance to get up-cl
 ose views of the astronomical objects visible in the sky that month which 
 could include the Moon’s craters\, Saturn’s rings\, Jupiter’s moons\
 , and distant galaxies. Experts will be on hand to answer questions and gu
 ide you through the night sky’s best features.</p><p>And of course\, sta
 y warm with complimentary cups of rich cocoa as you marvel at the universe
  above. Whether you&#39\;re an avid stargazer or a curious beginner\, Cosm
 os and Cocoa promises an evening filled with wonder and warmth.</p><p>No p
 rior experience necessary\, and all ages are welcome. Dress warmly and bri
 ng a flashlight with a red light setting (no white light allowed). Red lig
 ht flashlights will also be available for purchase.</p><p> Register at <a
  href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://rfo.simpletix.com&amp\;sa=D&amp
 \;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1730774305857537&amp\;usg=AOvVaw36Isj1KDwVGC6uG
 1l06IHQ" target="_blank">rfo.simpletix.com</a>. </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250916T005758Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
END:VEVENT
