SUMMARY:The Legendary Suga-T & Friends
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T160700
UID:260827rHz94OEkfUiMIiJOAO-dVw
DESCRIPTION:Suga -T is a multi-generational cultural icon combining music\
 , wellness\, entrepreneurship\, and community impact.\n\nDr. Tenina “Sug
 a-T” Stevens\, is a Multi-platinum and gold selling legendary music icon
  that is an internationally recognized recording artists entrepreneur\, sp
 eaker\, author\, podcast host\, and community advocate. Known worldwide as
  the original First Lady of The Click\, Suga-T helped shape Bay Area and W
 est Coast hip-hop culture alongside E-40\, D-Shot\, and B-Legit and many o
 thers.\n\nRecognized for her lyrical excellence\, commanding stage presenc
 e\, and timeless artistry\, Suga-T seamlessly bridges generations of music
  lovers with performances that blend classic hip-hop\, Southern Soul\, blu
 es\, funk\, and R&B
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Wine Tasting Mansion
