DESCRIPTION:Lynmar Estate invites guests to a relaxed Sunday afternoon in 
 its majestic Redwood Grove for  Pinot & Paella . Enjoy the natural beauty 
 of the estate while savoring Gerard's Paella\, a local favorite\, paired w
 ith Lynmar Estate wines. Gather around picnic tables filled with delicious
  flavors\, great conversation\, and good company as you take in the peacef
 ul surroundings of the estate. This laid-back experience offers the perfec
 t way to spend an afternoon enjoying exceptional food and wine in a beauti
 ful setting. Reservations are highly recommended\, as space is limited. Gu
 ests must be 21 or older. If reservations are unavailable\, contact Lynmar
  Estate to join the waitlist.
