DESCRIPTION:September 13 — Wine Brunch | Milford\, CT\n\nWines and More 
 | 11 AM–2 PM \n\nJoin Gundlach Bundschu for a special Sunday wine brunch
  at Wines and More in Milford. Enjoy a selection of wines from our histori
 c Rhinefarm estate in Sonoma\, paired with a relaxed brunch experience and
  the stories behind six generations of family winemaking. Come hungry\, co
 me curious\, and spend your Sunday with a little Sonoma in Connecticut. \n
 \nBOOK NOW
LOCATION:Gundland Bundschu Winery
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/wines-more-brunch/
