DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260915T133000
UID:260904p43Oc2YMsESxG8_08La7Iw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our September Chamber Luncheon! In celebration of 
 National Hispanic Heritage Month\, we’re pleased to welcome Hector Velaz
 quez for a conversation about The Latino Economic Opportunity. U.S. Latino
 s represent nearly a $4 trillion economy and are among the fastest-growing
  economic forces in the nation. Hector will bring that story home to Sonom
 a County\, highlighting the impact of Latino entrepreneurs\, the challenge
 s they face\, and how local businesses and community partners can share in
  this growth. Tuesday\, September 15 11:30 AM–1:30 PM Jimmy’s Lakeside
  Grill\, Windsor Come learn more about the economic opportunity happening 
 right here in our own backyard. Reserve your seat today!
LOCATION:Jimmy's Lakeside Grill
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1041125725211611/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
