DESCRIPTION:Venue Name: Marin Center Exhibit Hall Venue Address: 10 Ave of
  the FlagsSan Rafael\, CA 94903-5204 Venue Phone: \\(415\\)499-6400 Venue 
 Details: The Exhibit Hall offers 22\,500 square feet on one level and can 
 be partitioned for a variety of uses. With space for 105 booths\, the Hall
  hosts the major trade\, consumer\, and exhibit shows pre sented in Marin 
 County. The Hall also seats up to 1\,000 for luncheons and dinners\; and w
 ith the addition of the portable stage\, is availab le for dinner-dances\,
  corporate parties\, and special events. Venue Info:  Rental Information P
 rice: Free Ticket Info: N/A\n\nExplore resources\, services\, and activiti
 es at the 38th Annual Marin Senior Fair\, Northern California's largest an
 d longest-running senior information event. Featuring more than 150 exhibi
 tors\, the fair offers information\, produ cts\, and services for seniors\
 , caregivers\, and their families\, along with games\, free handouts\, and
  interactive activities.\n\nThis ye ar's theme\, "Not My First Rodeo: Sadd
 le Up for a Better Futu re\," includes western-themed entertainment\, deco
 rated booths\, l ive performances\, free morning coffee\, wellness screeni
 ngs\, COVID-19 and flu vaccinations\, raffle prizes\, and a variety of foo
 d options.\n\nAdmission and parking are free\, and complimentary shuttle s
 ervice is available to and from downtown San Rafael.
LOCATION:Marin Center Exhibit Hall
URL:https://www.marincounty.org/main/calendar#/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
