BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar Livewhale": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23869-cite-it-right-with-noodletools-mla-apa"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:Cite It Right with NoodleTools: MLA + APA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T180000
DTSTAMP:20260827T151522Z
UID:20260917T000000Z-23869@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T170000
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,1080,1080/644_cs_library_workshop_tour.rev.178605768
 7.png
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, you will learn how to sign up for an accoun
 t with NoodleTools. We will also provide examples to show how to create ci
 tations\, create a bibliography and check for errors. There will be time t
 o ask questions at the end of the overview —bring your sources along. Jo
 in us and learn how to cite your sources right!  This NoodleTools workshop
  will focus on the MLA + APA citation styles. Check with your instructor t
 o confirm the citation style appropriate for your research assignment. Whe
 n writing a research paper\, the discipline typically determines the citat
 ion style you will use.  Extra Credit: As students\, you have the option t
 o submit your instructor and course name when you register if you would li
 ke us to notify your instructor that you have attended the workshop for ex
 tra credit. Or\, you can work with your instructor on an alternative way t
 o provide evidence of your attendance.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260901T173831Z
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23869-cite-it-right-with-noodleto
 ols-mla-apa
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  In this workshop\, you will learn how to
  sign up for an account with NoodleTools. We will also provide examples to
  show how to create citations\, create a bibliography and check for errors
 . There will be time to ask questions at the end of the overview —bring 
 your sources along. Join us and learn how to cite your sources right!</p><
 p>  This NoodleTools workshop will focus on the MLA + APA citation styles.
  Check with your instructor to confirm the citation style appropriate for 
 your research assignment. When writing a research paper\, the discipline t
 ypically determines the citation style you will use.</p><p>  Extra Credit:
  As students\, you have the option to submit your instructor and course na
 me when you register if you would like us to notify your instructor that y
 ou have attended the workshop for extra credit. Or\, you can work with you
 r instructor on an alternative way to provide evidence of your attendance.
 </p>
