DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T180000
UID:260827c_xi36558kGAcQo1PZBgmg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of Dancing wines\, bites\, and vinyl sp
 un by Sea Rancher Richard Harris starting at 4pm. Dancing is a mother-daug
 hter vineyard in the sweet spot of Dry Creek Valley\, Sonoma County\, wher
 e cool ocean fog meets the dry heat of land. Dancing launched their first 
 expression in 2024\, with a collection of limited-release wines and fragra
 nces that celebrate the senses and inspire you to find your inner dance. T
 hey believe when it comes to the senses\, you like what you like. By letti
 ng go of structure\, they're making each sip and sniff less daunting for a
  new generation.\n\nMake your dinner reservation for the Dining Room follo
 wing the event.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
