X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/its-not-trash-reclaiming-and-transforming-opening-?aff=cityspark", "Press Democrat": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/its-not-trash-reclaiming-and-transforming-opening-?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/its-not-trash-reclaiming-and-transforming-opening-?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:It's Not Trash: Reclaiming and Transforming | Opening Reception
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T193000
UID:2607180afgULxWrEqD88jol25m6w
DESCRIPTION:Opening Reception: Thursday\, September 17\, 5:30-7:30pm\n\nPr
 esented in partnership with the Reuse Alliance and Recology San Francisco 
 and Santa Rosa\, It's Not Trash: Reclaiming and Transforming honors artist
 s who repurpose discarded materials to create work centered on sustainabil
 ity\, storytelling\, and community restoration.
