X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:2026 Maternal Child Health Conference
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T170000
UID:260904pTdSzagNoECMHFKrcucILw
DESCRIPTION:A conference for women & women's health providers.Too hot to h
 andle? Not for us! Our focus this year will be Hot Topics in Birth & Breas
 tfeeding--autonomy & choice\, VBAC\, vaginal breech birth\, new mastitis g
 uidelines\, pelvic floor health and non-pharmacologic pain management. Com
 e learn what the options are\, how to advocate for choice and how you can 
 make a difference.Ticket includes boxed lunch and contact hours. No same-d
 ay tickets. Address of event will be emailed with ticket confirmation.~ 6.
 75 CEU's approved by the California BRN \\#11761 ~~ 6.75 CERP’s approved
  by the IBCLE ~~ CME's & Physical Therapy CEU's provided by a joint partne
 rship with Sutter Health ~FULL-DAY TICKET PRICE: $200 through Sept. 7th\, 
 price increases to $250 on Sept. 8th.PELVIC FLOOR-ONLY AFTERNOON TICKETS: 
 $100\, no lunchTICKET SALES END SUNDAY\, SEPTEMBER 13TH\, AT 10PM!Topics &
  Speakers:- What do Women Want? Advocating for Choice in Maternal Child He
 althRosanne Gephart MSN\, CNM\, NP\, PHN\, IBCLC- Does Birth = Drugs and a
 n Epidural?Amy Popplewell\, FNP-Mastitis Management\, A New ApproachMary B
 aracco APRN\, CNM\, WHNP\, PHN-Pelvic Floor Health for LifeLaura Faye Geph
 art\, MD-What Happens After Baby — The Recovery Nobody Talks AboutMarci 
 Silverberg\, MPT\, PPCES-Birth Autonomy & Options--VBAC and Breech BirthWh
 itney Pinger\, CNM\, FACNM\, Breech Without BordersPlease join the Better 
 Beginnings board and volunteers from 5:00-6:00pm for a meet & greet wine s
 ocial immediately following our conference program!This activity has been 
 planned and implemented in accordance with the accreditation requirements 
 and policies of the Accreditation Council for Continuing Medical Education
  \\(ACCME\\) through the joint providership of Sutter Health and Better Be
 ginnings Inc. Sutter Health is accredited by the ACCME to provide continui
 ng medical education for physicians.
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/2026-maternal-child-hea
 lth-conference/19445686/2026-09-18T08
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
