DESCRIPTION:Purpose\, Profit & Impact is a dynamic event for business owne
 rs\, entrepreneurs\, nonprofit leaders and organizations ready to grow\, s
 trengthen their impact and build for long-term success. The event is prese
 nted in partnership with the Sonoma County Economic Development Collaborat
 ive \\(EDC\\).\n\nAttendees will hear from experienced leaders\, exchange 
 ideas\, discover valuable resources and explore practical strategies for s
 ustainable growth\, leadership\, financial strength\, partnerships and com
 munity impact. The event brings business and nonprofit leaders together to
  form meaningful relationships\, develop collaborations and identify new o
 pportunities.\n\nWhether you are growing a company\, launching a venture o
 r leading a nonprofit\, Purpose\, Profit & Impact will provide fresh ideas
  and connections to help move your organization and mission forward.\n\nFo
 r more information\, visit www.impactlime.com.
LOCATION:Oxford Suites
URL:http://www.impactlime.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
