 acility and sample our 2025 vintage from the barrel. Finally\, Jason will 
 host an educational seminar all about Merlot in our Club Room\, where he w
 ill open several finished Merlots from different vintages\, including a 
 special new release. Enjoy light bites thoughtfully paired with each glass
  through this rare\, all-Merlot experience.
