 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Michael Peter Edson is a director
 \, founder\, and strategist working at the intersection of tech\, culture\
 , and democracy.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website.
  (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
