 tegist working at the intersection of tech\, culture\, and democracy.</p><
 p><a href="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026" target="_blank" rel="no
 opener">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website.</a></p>
