DESCRIPTION:Join us every third Friday of the month\, July 17th\, August 2
 1st\, and September 18th. 4:00 PM-6:00 PM \n\nNapa Valley’s golden hour 
 just got an upgrade. Join us every third Friday from July through Septembe
 r for Sunset Social—a late-afternoon gathering set in the beautiful Stag
 s Leap District. Unwind with friends as you create your own burger to pair
  with a bottle of wine!\n\nEnjoy sweeping views of the vineyards and garde
 ns as the golden hour settles over the estate. Designed for connection\, r
 elaxation\, and the simple pleasures of wine country\, Sunset Social is th
 e perfect way to ease into the evening.
LOCATION:Pine Ridge Vineyards
