 arious comedians bringing fresh material\, big laughs\, and nonstop entert
 ainment.\n\nPresented in partnership with **Comedy IRL and sponsored by Ka
 nha**\, Tokes & Jokes blends premium cannabis\, delicious food\, and live 
 comedy into one unforgettable experience inside the North Bay's only canna
 bis social club. Come early to grab a drink\, enjoy dinner\, and settle in
  before the lights dim and the laughs begin.\n\n**Demos by: Potters\, Pres
 idential**\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** Friday\, September 18\, 2026\n\
 n**Doors Open:** 6:00 PM\n\n**DJ:** 6:00 PM - 8:00 PM\n\n**Comedy:** 8:00 
 PM - 10:00 PM\n\n**Ticket Tiers**\n\n**$25 — General Admission (Open Sea
 ting)** Entry to Tokes & Jokes 🎤 Open seating (first come\, first serve
 d). Come early for the best spot.\n\n**$35 — GA + Goodie Bag** A little 
 extra ✨ Entry + goodie bag ($20 value) included. Open seating (first com
 e\, first served). \n\n**$50 — Preferred Bucket Seat + Goodie Bag** Com
 fort upgrade 😌 Guaranteed bucket seat + shared table access\, plus good
 ie bag ($20 value) included. Limited seating.\n\n**⭐ $75 — Preferred B
 ucket + Premium Bag (Most Popular)** The crowd favorite ⭐ Guaranteed buc
 ket seat + shared table access\, plus upgraded goodie bag ($50 value) incl
 uded. Limited seating. \n\n**💎 $100 — Preferred Bucket + VIP Bag** Go
  big tonight **💎** Guaranteed bucket seat + shared table access\, plus 
 loaded goodie bag ($100 value) included. Limited seating. \n\n**🔥 $175
  — Couch Crew Pass (3 Guests + VIP Bag)** Bring your crew 🔥 Includes 
 admission for 3 guests\, reserved couch seating with a dedicated table\, p
 lus a premium bag ($150 value) included. **Only 11 couches.**\n\n**👑 $2
 00 — VIP Flex Pass + Elite Bag (Limited)** Top-tier perks 👑 Priority 
 seating plus elite goodie bag ($250 value) included. Very limited.\n\n21+ 
 Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis event
  is 21+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By attendi
 ng this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photogra
 phy and video recording may take place. Images and footage may be used by 
 Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes across various chann
 els\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise st
 ated. Event details\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCa
 nnabis consumption is limited to designated areas and must comply with all
  applicable local and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy
  entering the venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue p
 olicies.
