X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://papermillcreeksaloon.com/events/", "Press Democrat": "http://papermillcreeksaloon.com/events/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://papermillcreeksaloon.com/events/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Wreckless Strangers at the Paper Mill Creek Saloon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T203000
UID:2609052IbH3qYh9EusFPJYhB9yqA
DESCRIPTION:Fresh off a busy summer of performances across the Bay Area an
 d tour stops in **Littleton\, Colorado**\, and **Jackson Hole\, Wyoming**\
 , **Wreckless Strangers** return this fall with a trio of Northern Califor
 nia shows\, highlighted by an appearance at **Hardly Strictly Bluegrass** 
 in **San Francisco's Golden Gate Park**. The band will also perform at the
  historic **Paper Mill Creek Saloon** in **Forest Knolls** on **September 
 18** and **Rancho Nicasio** on **Friday\, November 20\,** while continuing
  to build momentum with national radio airplay and a climb up the Top 50 A
 mericana and AAA Singles charts.\n\nWith ***Dirty Souls***\, Wreckless Str
 angers return to their rock-and-roll roots\, delivering their rawest and m
 ost visceral studio effort to date. The six-song collection channels the a
 rena rock spirit of the '70s and '80s that shaped the band's earliest infl
 uences while bringing a fresh\, modern edge to the sound. The first single
 \, **"Dirty Soul\,"** continues to receive national airplay and is availab
 le on major streaming platforms. The full album was released in **March**.
 \n\n$15 at the door. 21+
LOCATION:Paper Mill Creek Saloon
URL:http://papermillcreeksaloon.com/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
