SUMMARY:Jack London Park Partners 2026 Gala: Jack's 150th - A Bold Wish
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
UID:ed3c2ebc2f9f88cf07da222cf561431e@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Jack London’s 150th birthday with an evening inspi
 red by his bold spirit\, big ideas\, and enduring love of this land. Join 
 friends for a jubilant night of food\, wine\, music\, and joy at the Park 
 where legacy meets celebration and the story continues to unfold. We’ll 
 toast to Jack’s extraordinary life\, reflect on the dream he left behind
 \, and dance into what comes next. It’s a birthday. It’s a milestone. 
 It’s a bold wish. •	When: Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 5:00-9:0
 0 •	Where: Jack L
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/jack-london-park-partners-2026-g
 ala-jacks-150th-a-bold-wish/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
