SUMMARY:California Coastal Cleanup
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T120000
UID:260812dmqnqhdMZ0KIibNB2-w6gQ
DESCRIPTION:Join 1000 of your Marin County neighbors at one of sixty count
 y sites to clean- clean-clean. Be a part of the largest volunteer event in
  the State and our 42nd year. We pick up trash and recyclables to keep the
  trash out of our oceans. We provide the tools and the fun - you are the h
 uman power that makes it all happen. Suitable for all family members. Be t
 he solution!
