DESCRIPTION:Looking for something different to do in Sonoma? Join us for a
  fun\, hands-on introduction to stained glass!\n\nIn this beginner-friendl
 y workshop\, you'll learn the basics of the copper foil method\, including
  how to apply copper foil\, solder\, clean\, and finish your very own stai
 ned glass sun catcher.\n\nAll glass is pre-cut\, ground\, and ready for yo
 u to jump right into copper foiling and soldering.  All materials and too
 ls are provided. Finished pieces will be ready to take home at the end of 
 class.\n\nPlease note: Please select your design when registering for the
  class. Due to the preparation required for each project\, design changes 
 cannot be made within 48 hours of the class. Glass colors may vary slightl
 y from the photos\, making every piece uniquely yours.\n\nAge: 18\\+
LOCATION:Art Escape
URL:https://www.artescapesonoma.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
