DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, September 19  Parade: Noon through downtown Guerne
 ville  Festival: Immediately following the parade \\(approximately 1:00 P
 M\\)\n\nCelebrate with a vibrant Pride Parade\, live entertainment\, local
  vendors\, community organizations\, family activities\, food and drinks\,
  and the Russian River Pride Beverage Garden.\n\nThis year's theme\, Let I
 t Flow\, celebrates joy\, creativity\, identity\, and the freedom to be yo
 urself. Whether you're marching\, dancing\, volunteering\, or cheering fro
 m the sidelines\, everyone is welcome.\n\nAdmission is free. Come spend th
 e day with us in the heart of the Russian River as we celebrate LGBTQIA\\+
  pride\, connection\, and community.
LOCATION:Main Street Guerneville
URL:https://russianriverpride.org/index.php
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
