DESCRIPTION:Unleashed Coffee\, a woman-owned\, direct-trade coffee roastin
 g company based in Solano County\, invites the community to Coffee Brewing
  101 on Saturday\, September 19th\, 2pm at Wild Oak Wellness in Suisun Val
 ley. A hands-on workshop covering the fundamentals of great coffee: sourci
 ng\, storage\, grind size\, and brew method. Attendees get hands-on with A
 eroPress\, French Press\, Pour Over\, and Cold Brew\, and take home a 12oz
  bag of Unleashed Coffee to keep practicing. Registration available at unl
 eashedcoffee.com/events.
LOCATION:Wild Oak Wellness
URL:http://unleashedcoffee.com/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
