DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T180000
UID:260206Na8zSmV_PEi6xU7fcTLeKQ
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come t
 ogether.\n\n Join us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tas
 ting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acro
 ss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll a
 nd Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sou
 nds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\nS.R. Laws\n\nRooted in Northern
  California and shaped by a lifetime of musical discovery\, singer-songwri
 ter\, S.R. Laws\, crafts heartfelt songs with slow-burning passion and vi
 vid storytelling. Now based in Sonoma County\, he tours and performs origi
 nal rock with his band\, The Heartsleeves\, drawing listeners in with melo
 dies inspired by legends like John Hiatt\, Rodney Crowell\, and Neil Finn.
 \n\nDetails\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fi
 ll up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and famil
 y friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
