SUMMARY:Community Soil Foundation's Gather in the Garden Annual Benefit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T200000
UID:260820-60iCi82EUaf6l0sg477ow
DESCRIPTION:Gather in the Garden\, Community Soil Foundation’s Annual Be
 nefit Dinner!\n\nSpend a harvest evening with us in the garden surrounded 
 by good food\, live music\, neighbors\, friends\, and the beautiful outdoo
 r space we share.\n\n Seasonal garden dinner\, live music\, garden tours\
 , oak woodland walks\, family activities\, and community connection\n\nSat
 urday\, September 19 | 4 PM – Dark | 450 Noonan Ranch Lane\n\nFunds rais
 ed from the evening support Community Soil Foundation’s work providing f
 ree outdoor education for local students\, fresh food for families\, and o
 ngoing stewardship of our community garden and oak woodland.\n\nMost of al
 l\, this evening is about bringing our community together. If the suggeste
 d ticket price doesn’t fit your budget right now\, pay what you can. Eve
 ryone is welcome.\n\nCome eat\, wander\, listen to music\, explore the gar
 den\, and celebrate another year of growing together.
LOCATION:Maddux Ranch Park
URL:https://www.communitysoil.org/2026-annual-benefit
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
