SUMMARY:On Board: A Skateboard Art Auction to Benefit Forestville Skatespo
 t
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T180000
UID:260810yza5Dk8OgUOfVY1HNiNE0g
DESCRIPTION:On September 19 from 4 to 6 p.m.\, Forestville Skatespot\, in 
 partnership with Sonoma Pizza Co.\, will present On Board: A Skateboard Ar
 t Auction to Benefit Forestville Skatespot — a free community gathering 
 and silent auction featuring one-of-a-kind art created on skateboard decks
 .\n\nThe event brings together 16 artists\, each of whom created a unique 
 piece specifically for the auction. The lineup reflects a wide range of ar
 tistic backgrounds\, including painters\, musicians\, a well-known type de
 signer\, and several artists affiliated with Creativity Explored\, a San F
 rancisco studio supporting artists with developmental disabilities. Attend
 ees and remote participants alike can place online bids. Proceeds directly
  support Forestville Skatespot\, a nonprofit working to build a free\, pub
 lic skatepark in Forestville.
LOCATION:Sonoma Pizza Co.
URL:https://www.forestvilleskatespot.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
