DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 10th anniversary of this unforgettable fundraise
 r at Charlie's Acres\, set in the heart of Sonoma Wine Country\, the eveni
 ng supports rescued farmed animals and the sanctuary's humane education an
 d emergency response programs. Guests can meet animal residents\, enjoy lo
 cal wine\, cocktails\, live music\, and a plant-based dinner from Nova Ter
 ra Kitchen & Creamery. The event also features tethered hot air balloon ri
 des\, sanctuary tours aboard the Sonoma Valley Wine Trolley\, and an excit
 ing auction with exclusive experiences and unique packages. This special c
 elebration offers a meaningful evening of community\, compassion\, and sup
 port for the animals who call Charlie's Acres home.
