DESCRIPTION:Join us at the reception for our new exhibit. We'll have nibbl
 es and beverages\, and lots of wonderful art. The show is called Solace: A
  feeling of emotional comfort or a person/thing that brings relief during 
 hard times.  This show is about the beautiful moments where you get lost 
 in the beautiful moments.  Sometimes just a walk in nature is enough.  T
 his show captures the solace that these two artists have translated onto t
 heir canvases.  Take a breath\, take a look\, and enjoy the solace.
