DESCRIPTION:The OLE Health Foundation marks its 40th anniversary during th
 e Vida OLE! Weekend\, culminating with the Vida OLE! Dinner & Auction at Q
 uintessa. Nestled among the rolling hills of Rutherford\, Quintessa’s b
 reathtaking grounds set the stage as the night unfolds with a spirited Fie
 sta reception\, followed by a lavish four-course dinner from Brindare’s
  Chef Cognetti paired with exceptional wines. Guests will bid on rare wine
 s\, extraordinary travel and once-in-a-lifetime experiences during a live 
 auction before Grammy Award-winning Pacific Mambo Orchestra closes the cel
 ebration. All in pursuit of one shared belief: that everyone in Napa Vall
 ey deserves access to exceptional healthcare.\n\nDinner & Auction Price: $
 1\,000 per person \\($750 tax-deductible\\)\n\nVida OLE! Weekend Pass: $1\
 ,750 per person \\($1\,150 tax-deductible\\)
LOCATION:Quintessa
