DESCRIPTION:Amazing Magician and Mentalist Robert Goleman returns to Clove
 rdale with one performance only at Cloverdale Performing Arts Center. Be p
 repared to be amazed with The Joy of Astonishment\, as Robert presents his
  singular blend of magic and mentalism in a performance designed to keep a
 udiences on the edge of their seats.\n\nWith more than 50 years of perform
 ing experience\, Robert brings the confidence\, intelligence\, and craftsm
 anship of a lifetime onstage in The Joy of Astonishment – An Evening of 
 Magic and Mentalism.
