SUMMARY:HEROES & HUES for Vallejo Veterans
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T160000
UID:260830G7--CiGKtUeRQwRyg_9XoQ
DESCRIPTION:Dear Disabled American Veterans \\(DAV\\) Ozie Boler Chapter 2
 1 Members\,\n\nWe’re excited to share a fun and creative opportunity for
  our veterans! DAV Chapter 21 invites you to Heroes & Hues\, a FREE vetera
 ns-only painting event where we can enjoy an afternoon of creativity\, cam
 araderie\, and good company.\n\n HEROES & HUES — EVENT DETAILS\n\nDate:
  Sunday\, September 20\, 2026 Time: 1:00 p.m. Location: Veterans Hall Addr
 ess: 420 Admiral Callaghan Ln\, Vallejo\, CA\n\nOur painting session will 
 be led by @phiamiah of @noblecinemastudios\, who will guide participants t
 hrough the painting experience. No artistic experience is necessary—just
  come ready to have some fun!\n\n FREE for Veterans  25 slots available 
 — limited space  RSVP ONLY — No walk-ins\n\nTo reserve your spot:  T
 ext 707-651-8932\n\nWhether you consider yourself an artist or haven’t p
 icked up a paintbrush in years\, this is an opportunity to relax\, create 
 something meaningful\, and spend time with fellow veterans.\n\nWith only 2
 5 spaces available\, please RSVP early if you would like to participate.\n
 \nWe hope to see many of our Chapter 21 veterans there for an afternoon of
  Heroes\, Hues\, creativity\, and camaraderie!\n\nWith appreciation and ca
 maraderie\,\n\nHumphry Angeles Adjutant & Treasurer DAV Ozie Boler Chapter
  21 Vallejo\, California
LOCATION:Vallejo Veterans Hall
