BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/iona-lecture-trevor-houser", "Press Democrat": "https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/iona-lecture-trevor-houser"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/iona-lecture-trevor-houser"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Contemplating Climate Change\, with Trevor Houser
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T150000
UID:2608311_iN1S15kUOY-hbql0xTCw
DESCRIPTION:Contemplating Climate Change\, with Trevor Houser\n\nSunday\, 
 September 20\, 1:00 pm \n\nIn this Iona Lecture\, climate change research
 er and former diplomat Trevor Houser will provide an overview of the curre
 nt state of global efforts to address climate change and constructive step
 s individuals and communities can take to advance those efforts. He will a
 lso reflect on how faith can provide both a refuge from environmental anxi
 ety and a guide to personal engagement. \n\nJoin us for this important af
 ternoon of conversation with lecture at 1 pm and wine and cheese reception
  to follow.  Free and Open to the Public. \n\nTrevor Houser is a partner
  at Rhodium Group\, an independent research provider. He leads the company
 's Energy & Climate practice\, which analyzes the effects of policy and ma
 rket developments on greenhouse gas emissions and energy systems. Trevor a
 lso co-directs the Climate Impact Lab\, a consortium of leading research i
 nstitutions quantifying the impact of climate change on communities around
  the world.\n\nTrevor previously served as a climate change negotiator for
  the U.S. Department of State and as a Visiting Fellow at the Peterson Ins
 titution for International Economics. He has written three books on energy
  policy and global climate change\, including The Economic Risks of Climat
 e Change: An American Perspective.
LOCATION:St. Columba's Inverness
URL:https://www.stcolumbasinverness.org/iona-lecture-trevor-houser
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
