DESCRIPTION:Verismo Opera presents Tosca by Giacomo Puccini\n\nFree Admiss
 ion. Become a member to support our new free admission policy.  Membershi
 p for $30 per person will be good for a year from purchase and will entitl
 e members to early seating \\(before non-members\\) for performances.\n\n
  Stage Director: Eliza O’ Malley \n\nConductor: Carlos Hernandez\n\nWi
 th Chamber Orchestra and English Supertitles \n\nIn association with Mir
 a Theatre Guild\n\nFor company information and to purchase memberships vis
 it www.verismoopera.org\n\n Love\, lust\, jealousy\, deception\, torture\
 , murder\, suicide – all in one opera – Tosca.  An idealistic artist\
 , a celebrated singer and a corrupt police chief engage in a fierce battle
  of wills in this tempestuous tale of cruelty and deception. With its them
 es of political intrigue\, sexual intimidation and official hypocrisy\, Pu
 ccini’s great masterpiece rings true today through its powerfully dramat
 ic and gorgeous music.\n\nMira Theatre Guild\, 51 Daniels Avenue\, Vallejo
 \, CA 94590\n\n- September 12\, 2026 \\(Saturday 7:00pm\\)\n\n- September 
 13           \\(Sunday 3:00pm\\)\n\n- September 19       
     \\(Saturday 7:00pm\\)\n\n- September 20           \\(Sun
 day 3:00pm\\)\n\n- September 26           \\(Saturday 7:00pm\\)\
 n\n- September 27           \\(Sunday 3:00pm\\)
LOCATION:Mira Theatre Guild
URL:http://www.verismoopera.org
