X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Meditation & Ceremony
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T100000
UID:260825pi1wcr2vEEK4pt3sHC32hA
DESCRIPTION:Join us in honoring the Autumn Equinox with a guided meditatio
 n\, gentle breathwork\, and community ceremony in Osmosis’ beautiful Med
 itation Garden. \n\nTogether\, we will: \n\nReflect on and harvest the les
 sons of the past season\n\nRelease what no longer serves you\n\nSet meanin
 gful intentions for the season ahead\n\nConnect in ceremony and community\
 n\nTickets \n\nBase Admission: $10\n\nPremium Admission: $25\n\nincludes a
  relaxing Cedar Enzyme Footbath following the ceremony\n\nAbout Your Guide
 \n\nEden Rumelt is a Reverend Priestess\, Ritual Dancer\, and Embodiment T
 eacher with more than 20 years of experience leading classes\, workshops\,
  and retreats. She has also been a Massage Therapist at Osmosis Day Spa si
 nce 2013\, bringing a deeply grounded and nurturing approach to her work. 
 \n\nJOIN US!
URL:https://osmosis.com/event/autumn-equinox-meditation-and-ceremony-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
