DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, September 22\, 2026\n\n6:00pm    Doors open 5:30 p
 m\n\nFree entry. Donations greatly appreciated.\n\nConcessions open for pu
 rchase.\n\nAssistive listening devices available.\n\n Sponsored by Califo
 rnia Retired Teachers Association Div 35\n\nDewey Finn \\(Jack Black\\) is
  an energetic guitarist who gets kicked out of his bar band and needs a jo
 b fast. He pretends to be a substitute music teacher at a top private elem
 entary school\, where he introduces his students to the rock legends he lo
 ves. This surprises the strict principal \\(Joan Cusack\\). As Dewey helps
