X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/insight-meditation-day-of-practice-a-mini-retreat-hc3d26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/insight-meditation-day-of-practice-a-mini-retreat-hc3d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/insight-meditation-day-of-practice-a-mini-retreat-hc3d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Insight Meditation Day of Practice: A Mini Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T150000
UID:260715mBaSAETc-0WCqH66_bSkIw
DESCRIPTION:with Howard Cohn\n\nThis day of practicing Insight Meditation 
 (vipassanā) is an invitation to develop and strengthen our capacity for m
 indfulness and friendliness. Practicing with a relaxed and kind attention 
 to our present moment experience\, we are able to more easily welcome all 
 experience and reduce our reactivity. Direct experience of the present mom
 ent enables us to connect with ourselves more intimately\, understand for 
 ourselves what creates both suffering and happiness\, and experience the f
 reedom and ease that is our natural state.\n\nInstructions for both sittin
 g and walking meditation will be offered\, along with time for questions. 
 This day is designed both for those who haven’t yet attended a residenti
 al retreat and would like to experience a “mini retreat\,” as well as 
 for those with more retreat experience who just want to reconnect with the
 ir practice
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/insight-meditation-day
 -of-practice-a-mini-retreat-hc3d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
