DESCRIPTION:Join the Fall Goddess Group!\n\nThis four-week autumn class ex
 plores dark goddesses.Each time we focus on one deity: Nyx\, Hecate\, The 
 Morrigan\, and Cerridwen.Explore their old myths\, connect with meditation
 \, write in a journal\, and make a small craft to honor her power.\n\nMeet
 ing dates: are the 2nd & 4th Friday nights in September and October 6:30-8
 pm (9/11\, 9/25\, 10/9\, 10/23)\n\n$88 is for ALL four weeks ($22/week)
