X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/digital-detox-the-wisdom-of-rest-balance-and-ease-nm1d26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/digital-detox-the-wisdom-of-rest-balance-and-ease-nm1d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/digital-detox-the-wisdom-of-rest-balance-and-ease-nm1d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Digital Detox: The Wisdom of Rest\, Balance\, and Ease
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T150000
UID:260715JfJQQ6dDgUezgtw0U1BZZg
DESCRIPTION:with Nikki Mirghafori\n\nIn a world of constant demands\, endl
 ess to-do lists\, and attention pulled in every direction\, our nervous sy
 stems can tighten\, leaving us drained and overwhelmed. This daylong offer
 s a welcoming invitation to pause\, breathe\, and rediscover the wisdom of
  rest\, restoration\, spaciousness\, and mindful presence. Guided meditati
 ons\, embodied awareness\, silence\, and time in nature help settle the bo
 dy\, steady the mind\, and renew energy and attention\, gently returning u
 s to what matters most. Practices of lovingkindness and equanimity nourish
  the heart\, reminding us that we are always enough. Equanimity does not m
 ean not caring—it means caring deeply with wisdom and balance. Through m
 indfulness\, we learn to meet life with greater clarity and kindness rathe
 r than reactivity. Rest here is not selfish: it replenishes us for the ben
 efit of ourselves and others. Join us to cultivate a more spacious and eas
 eful way of being\, and step into more freedom.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/digital-detox-the-wisd
 om-of-rest-balance-and-ease-nm1d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
