 d Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new soun
 ds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n7 Acre Holler Acre Holleris Sono
 ma County–based duo Cori Wood and Layne Bowen\, blending rich harmonies 
 with Appalachian-inspired folk and Americana. \n\nDetails\n\nNo cover. Wa
 lk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recom
 mend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
