BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/ten-times-better-and-about-face", "Press Democrat": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/ten-times-better-and-about-face"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/ten-times-better-and-about-face"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Culture in Choreography - Asian American Pioneers In Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T180000
UID:2608225ozHnPa7XE2YxBtAPVFHyw
DESCRIPTION:*Culture In Choreography*\, a new ongoing cinematic series at 
 The Jarvis Conservatory\, explores diverse perspectives and experiences in
  dance.\n\nThe inaugural screening features two documentaries by acclaimed
  filmmaker Jennifer Lin (*Beethoven in Berlin*)\, offering complementary p
 erspectives on the Asian American experience in ballet. Together\, the fil
 ms journey from a study of the past to a benchmark for the future\, celebr
 ating Asian American pioneers in dance and the artists who are carrying th
 eir legacy forward.\n\nThrough these compelling stories\, *Culture In Cho
 reography* invites audiences to reflect on the people\, histories\, and c
 ultural perspectives that continue to shape the world of dance.\n\n**TEN T
 IMES BETTER** unveils the remarkable story of an 88-year-old Chinese black
 jack dealer in Las Vegas whose forgotten past reveals an extraordinary pla
 ce in ballet history.\n\n**ABOUT FACE: DISRUPTING BALLET** is a 60-minute 
 documentary following two New York City dancers as they challenge the elit
 e ballet world to confront and eliminate racial stereotypes embedded in be
 loved classics such as *The Nutcracker* and *La Bayadère*.\n\nTogether\, 
 the films serve as bookends to the story of Asians in ballet—one uncover
 ing a hidden chapter from the past\, the other documenting artists shaping
  a more inclusive future. Both films were directed by acclaimed filmmaker\
 , Jennifer Lin (Beethoven In Beijing).\n\nSaturday\, September 26th 4:00pm
  Tickets are $15
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/ten-times-better-and-about-
 face
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
