DESCRIPTION:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert September 26\, 2026
 \n\nConcert 5:00-6:30 p.m. \\(Doors 4:30 p.m.\\) | Potluck After Party 6:3
 0-7:45 p.m.\n\nTICKETS: General $25/$20 Seniors and Youth | At the door: $
 35/$30 starting at 4:30 p.m.\n\nHARDLY STRICTLY IRISH \\(Suzuki Cady and J
 immy Murphy\\) - An uplifting\, signature mix of traditional Irish tunes a
 nd Roots-Americana vocal blends on fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, banjo\, an
 d bodhrán in a beautiful space with great acoustics\, comfortable seats\,
  room to dance\, and plenty of parking!\n\nBring a potluck dish \\(optiona
 l\\) to share after the concert at 6:30 p.m. Celebrate the bounty of the f
 ull Harvest Moon in a beautiful sanctuary or at the lovely outdoor fountai
 n circle at sunset!\n\n500 Robinson Road\, Sebastopol CA 95472\n\nMore inf
 ormation: https://suzukicady.com
LOCATION:St. Stephen's Sanctuary
