UID:260114hcI0ZI8y5Eat3OauWHAKBA
DESCRIPTION:Sing and dance along to your favorite tunes with Beatles tribu
 te duo Semi Fab! The band plays Beatles songs from the first album on\, wh
 ile Redwood Cafe offers great food and an extensive beer and wine list. Ly
