DESCRIPTION:Calling antique and collectible lovers! Browse and shop the 40
 th Annual Petaluma Antique Faire\, set in beautiful\, relaxing Historic Do
 wntown Petaluma. \n\nHistoric Downtown Petaluma is "The Bay Area's Premie
 r Antique Center\," and transforms into an antique marketplace twice a yea
 r. Amid the beautiful historic buildings\, one-of-a-kind stores\, restaura
 nts and cafes\, you’ll find an incomparable selection of affordable anti
 ques from 200+ dealers. The show boasts a variety of estate jewelry\, line
 ns\, furniture\, art\, kitchenware\, vintage décor\, books\, and all kind
 s of unusual collectibles to suit everyone's budget.\n\nMore than 8\,000 d
 iscerning collectors and first-time buyers wishing to collect and invest i
 n real antiques find treasures at Petaluma’s Fall Antique Faire. This fr
 ee fair spans Kentucky Street\, Fourth Street\, the A Street parking lot\,
  and Western Avenue.
