SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - Robert Dehlinger's Alpha Rhythm King
 s
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T170000
UID:260713fcyJUqo1CEmljDtaBgWSGQ
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026. This week's
  lineup features Robert Dehlinger's Alpha Rhythm Kings! Established in 201
 7\, the Alpha Rhythm Kings have created quite a stir with music fans\, cra
 fting an exciting "King Size California sound" that No Depression magazine
  calls "the badge of authenticity." The "swaggering" \\(Washington Post\\)
  ensemble\, led by Rob Dehlinger's "exhilarating" trumpet and "magnetic" v
 ocals \\(Jazz Corner\\)\, has become a favorite with audiences all over th
 e globe\, from Idaho to Indiana\, and Beverly Hills to Budapest. In 2025\,
  Rob Dehlinger and the Alpha Rhythm Kings were invited to Osaka\, Japan\, 
 to represent the United States as performers at the World Expo. Sonoma Sun
 days are free and open to all\, thanks to the generous support of the Sono
 ma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Fou
 ndation. Pack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the 
 Plaza!
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-robert-de
 hlingers-alpha-rhythm-kings-2/
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
