BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://events.humanitix.com/valley-games-x"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Swingin' in the Valley : Swing Dance w/ Live Music by Josh and the
  Wittness
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T203000
UID:260827Dkh5gp90t0iMCiI4Wehj5Q
DESCRIPTION:Swingin’ in the Valley : w/ Josh and the Wittness : Communit
 y Dance w/ Live music & Dance Class\n\nOn Sunday\, September 27\, the San 
 Geronimo Valley Community Center is excited to welcome home Valley native 
 Josh Witt to host the very first Swingin' in the Valley!  The dance class
  and community dance with live music will begin at 5pm at the Woodacre Imp
 rovement Club.\n\nA performing musician\, bandleader\, and San Geronimo Va
 lley favorite\, Josh first took the stage at the Community Center during t
 he 2005 St. Patrick's Day Talent Show. Since then\, he has earned a Bachel
 or of Music in Vocal Performance from Berklee College of Music\, spent nea
 rly a decade performing in Boston\, and now leads his own swing\, rock 'n'
  roll\, and doo-wop band\, Josh and the Wittness \\(pun very much intended
 \\). More recently\, Josh began hosting community swing dance events while
  also dipping his toes into becoming an instructor. He is excited to bring
  all these new explorations and talents back to his hometown.\n\nThe eveni
 ng begins with a one-hour beginner-friendly swing dance lesson led by Josh
 . No experience or partner is necessary—participants will learn the basi
 cs of Lindy Hop and gain the confidence to enjoy the dance floor throughou
 t the night.\n\nFollowing the lesson\, guests will dance to two one-hour l
 ive music sets\, with a 15-minute intermission between them. At the end of
  the break\, Josh will lead everyone in the Shim Sham\, the iconic three-m
 inute Lindy Hop line dance that originated in the tap dancing tradition an
 d has become a beloved swing dance classic.\n\nWhether you plan to dance a
 ll night or simply enjoy the music and lively atmosphere\, everyone is wel
 come. Perimeter seating will be available for guests who prefer to watch r
 ather than dance.\n\nSwingin' in the Valley also offers the perfect opport
 unity to dust off your dancing shoes before the Community Center's Heart 
 of the Valley Benefit on Saturday\, October 10\, featuring live music by B
 ig Sandy and His Fly-Rite Boys.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_
 \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\
 _\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n5:00pm - One hour Dance 
 Lesson\n\n6:00pm - Community Dance with Live Music\n\n7:00pm -  Band Int
 ermission\\*\n\n\\*learn the Shim Sham! Lindy Hop’s premiere line dance\
 n\n7:30pm - Second set of dance and music
LOCATION:Woodacre Improvement Club
URL:https://events.humanitix.com/valley-games-x
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
