DESCRIPTION:checklistMore DetailscommentDescriptionmanage_accountsInstruct
 or InfoinfoFAQprogram overviewThe goal of this class is to have students g
 ain fluency and confidence with their arithmetic and numeracy skills\, all
  while having fun and being creative with numbers. Students will leave wit
 h skills that they can apply in their future math classes. This class is a
 ppropriate for kids who don’t think they are a “math person” as well
