ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,742,742/675_cs_-_identity_leadership_summit_-_Dr_Bry
 on_Reaves.rev.1787072712.png
CATEGORIES:Intercultural Center
DESCRIPTION:The Identity and Leadership Summit is an event where students 
 are able to learn about how to be leaders and social justice advocates.  T
 he goal is that it prepares students to understand who they are\, build ri
 ght relationships\, examine power\, and take meaningful action with the ca
 mpus and South County community. Grounded in SRJC Petaluma's small-campus 
 experience and commitment to connection\, the framework recognizes that le
 adership develops through identity\, place\, reflection\, relationship\, a
 nd shared responsibility.  Keynote: Dr. Bryon ReavesFor more information\,
  visit the Identity and Leadership Summit website here.  &#160\;  SRJC Pet
 aluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T171429Z
LOCATION:Mike Smith Hall\, PC 500 - SRJC Petaluma
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23223-identity-and-leadership-sum
 mit
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The <em>Identity and Leadership Summit</
 em> is an event where students are able to learn about how to be leaders a
 nd social justice advocates.</p><p>  The goal is that it prepares students
  to understand who they are\, build right relationships\, examine power\, 
 and take meaningful action with the campus and South County community. Gro
 unded in SRJC Petaluma's small-campus experience and commitment to connect
 ion\, the framework recognizes that leadership develops through identity\,
  place\, reflection\, relationship\, and shared responsibility.</p><p>  Ke
 ynote: Dr. Bryon Reaves</p><p><a href="https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/iden
 tity-and-leadership-summit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more inform
 ation\, visit the <em>Identity and Leadership Summit</em> website here.</a
 ></p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petal
 uma\, CA 94954</p>
