 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.ZZheng works at the intersection 
 of operations\, design\, and AI\, helping organizations scale through bett
 er systems\, stronger alignment\, and more effective teams.Learn more on t
 he SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-t
 alks-2026)
