 ivileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman fightin
 g for her say in a male-dominated world.  &#160\;Ticketing:Visit SRJC's Th
 eatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets. (https://srjc.universityt
 ickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=34)
