 works from six students who participated in a seven-week art residency pro
 gram.</p><p>  The students selected trash from Recology's Materials Recove
 ry Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits with wa
 ste.</p><p>  TRASH (The Recology Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration 
 between Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  This event is an SRJC 
 Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  &
 #160\;</p><p><a href="https://libraries.santarosa.edu/mahoney_gallery" tar
 get="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about the Herold Mahoney 
 Library Gallery\, visit their website here.</a></p>
