X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:Emilia - SRJC Theatre Arts
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T203000
DTSTAMP:20260820T095224Z
UID:20261011T023000Z-23509@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T193000
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/677_cs_-_Emilia_SRJC_Theatre_arts.rev.1787251172.png
CATEGORIES:Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Emilia by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is a passionate\, feminist reim
 agining of the life of 17th-century poet and musician Emilia Bassano. The 
 play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delves into her journey from a pr
 ivileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman fightin
 g for her say in a male-dominated world.  &#160\;Ticketing:Visit SRJC's Th
 eatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets. (https://srjc.universityt
 ickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=34)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T165717Z
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium Studio Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23509-emilia-srjc-theatre-arts
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Emilia</em> by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is
  a passionate\, feminist reimagining of the life of 17th-century poet and 
 musician Emilia Bassano. The play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delv
 es into her journey from a privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazi
 ng poet\, and a woman fighting for her say in a male-dominated world.</p><
 p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srjc.univers
 itytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=34" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vi
 sit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets.</a></p>
