 unity members together for our educational open house and Día de los Muer
 tos celebration</strong>\, giving guests an opportunity to experience the 
 energy and diversity of our community\, explore college and career pathway
 s\, and to connect with SRJC programs and local community organizations.<b
 r />  From colorful performances and hands-on art activities to live music
 \, and local food favorites\, there's something for everyone at SRJC Petal
 uma's biggest event of the year.</p><p>  Whether you're visiting with fami
 ly\, friends\, or flying solo\, you'll find inspiration around every corne
