X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:Dave Kanter - Human Agency & Machine Inquiry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T120000
DTSTAMP:20260903T100259Z
UID:20261023T180000Z-23943@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T110000
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,500,500/710_cs_-_ai-speaking-series-wilde-500x500.pn
 g.jpg
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher 
 education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\, 
 but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities fo
 r research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depends en
 tirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Dave Kanter is an AI systems arch
 itect and engineering leader with provisional patent on agent feedback arc
 hitecture.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (http
 s://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T175426Z
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23943-dave-kanter-human-agency-ma
 chine-inquiry
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  As generative AI becomes embedded across
  disciplines\, higher education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle bet
 ween opposing camps\, but of intentional design.</p><p>  Generative system
 s offer novel capabilities for research\, creation\, and learning\, yet th
 eir ultimate value depends entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.</p>
 <p><strong>Dave Kanter</strong> is an AI systems architect and engineering
  leader with provisional patent on agent feedback architecture.</p><p><a h
 ref="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener
 ">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website.</a></p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:23943
