SUMMARY:Stars & Cider ~ Docent and Member Party!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T213000
DTSTAMP:20260905T041944Z
UID:3u9rgaht008nq2t7ds41luova8@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20250924T185713Z
DESCRIPTION:Sip hot spiced cider\, enjoy festive treats\, and take part in
  a variety of autumn-inspired activities before heading outside to explore
  the night sky through our telescopes.<br><br>Our Docent and Member Partie
 s celebrate community\, curiosity\, and the joy of gathering under the sta
 rs. Activities vary from year to year\, so you might find yourself paintin
 g a pumpkin\, or hunting for planets in a themed observatory scavenger hun
 t\, or simply relaxing with cider and cookies in costume alongside your fe
 llow stargazers.<br><br>Come for a tour\, meet our volunteers\, ask questi
 ons\, and enjoy an easygoing evening under the stars dedicated to the peop
 le who help RFO thrive.<br> <br>Not yet a member? You can sign up for mem
 bership here: <a href="https://rfo.org/index.php/membership/">https://rfo.
 org/index.php/membership/</a><br><br>While this event is free to members a
 nd docents and their families\, please sign up at <a href="http://rfo.simp
 letix.com" target="_blank">rfo.simpletix.com</a> using your member code so
  we know how many people to expect. Thank you!<br><br>If there are additio
 nal questions\, please email <a href="mailto:info@rfo.org" target="_blank"
 >info@rfo.org</a>. Thank you\, and we look forward to seeing you at future
  events.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260112T184502Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Robert Ferguson Observatory
END:VEVENT
