SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTSTAMP:20260820T143514Z
UID:20261029T070000Z-23554@calendar.santarosa.edu
