UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/366/29891100/0/0
DTSTART:20261031T170000Z
DTEND:20261031T220000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/366/1793466000000
SUMMARY: Drawing Pumpkins & Gourds with Colored Pencil
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin\n\nDate: Saturday\, October
  31st 2026\n\nTime: 10:00AM-3:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n\nFee: $9
 5.00\n\n\nOften used to decorate and celebrate the autumn season and Than
 ksgiving\, pumpkins and gourds entertain us with their whimsical shapes a
 nd warm vibrant colors. In this workshop\, students will learn how to dra
 w gourds with colored pencil. The morning portion of class will focus on 
 colored pencil principles and techniques such as underpainting\, layering
  of color\, color transition and creating color palettes. After a short b
 reak\, the afternoon will be dedicated to hands-on drawing time with indi
 vidual one-on-one assistance and a demo. All levels welcomed!\n\nTo regis
 ter\, please contact Victoria at kochergi@sonic.net mailto:kochergi@sonic
 .net or (707) 479-3336.\n\nVictoria A. Kochergin is a local botanical art
 ist and instructor who works with colored pencil and acrylics. Her artwor
 k has been exhibited in galleries\, wineries\, botanical gardens\, intern
 ational shows and on Alcatraz. For more information about Victoria\, plea
 se visit her website at www.victoriakochergin.com http://www.victoriakoch
 ergin.com/\n\nImage: “Pumpkin Spice” Victoria A. Kochergin © 2024
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Botanical,Colored-Pencil
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
