BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Uptown Theatre Napa": "https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/tusk-the-classic-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:uptowntheatrenapa
SUMMARY:TUSK: The Classic Tribute to Fleetwood Mac
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261105T200000
UID:tribe-25799@uptowntheatrenapa.com
DESCRIPTION:November 5\, 2026PURCHASE TICKETS HEREDoors 7pm/ Show 8pmAges:
  12+Playing the hits and deep cuts spanning the careers of Rock N Roll Hal
 l of Fame inductees Fleetwood Mac\, Tusk has been crisscrossing the countr
 y since 2008 as The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute. Five pro musicians turn
 ed into masters of their trade through decades of individual music study\,
