  focusing on the\, estranged relationship between royal sisters Elsa and A
 nna. When Elsa loses control of her ice powers the kingdom is plunged into
  eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embarks on a journey with Kristoff
 \, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and heal the kingdom.Ticketing:Visit
  SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets. (https://srjc.u
 niversitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=37)
