SUMMARY: Crepe Paper Poinsettias Workshop
DESCRIPTION:\nInstructor: Susan Crawford\nDate: Saturday\, November 14th\
 nTime: 10:00AM - 2:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $60\n\n\nJoin u
 s to unlock your inner florist and create stunning crepe paper flowers.\n
 \nAll of us love to receive flowers but we hate to see them go. Join me w
 hile I instruct you to construct realistic crepe paper Mistletoe. Make th
 ese beautiful flowers for someone special or as a treat for yourself. Eac
 h petal and leaf are hand cut from artisanal Italian crepe paper and then
  assembled by hand.\n\nEnjoy a relaxed and creative atmosphere as you lea
 rn to create your own masterpiece. This beginner-friendly class is design
 ed to open up your imagination by learning basic techniques when using cr
 epe paper as the flower composition. All necessary supplies and tools wil
 l be provided. Just bring your inspired-artful love of flowers. Participa
 nts will take home their finished sprig of Mistletoe.\n\nTo register: ple
 ase email mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.c
 om Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com mailto:Crawfordsusan00@gmail.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Crepe-Paper-Flowers
