DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart\nDate: Monday\, November 16th\nT
 ime: 1:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nIn my on
 going Gel-Printing & Collage workshop I want to offer you the opportunity
  to collage with your handmade papers\, starting with an easy project pro
 gressing each class to a more challenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate tech
 niques for making papers with and without the Gel-Plate. We will create a
  collection of cohesive\npapers. The best of them you will use for your c
 ollage projects.\n\nSome examples are a fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with 
 flowers\, a grouping of various cups and more.\n\nOne requirement for thi
 s class is that you are familiar and comfortable cutting shapes with an X
 -Acto knife or a similar tool.\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please 
