 ween royal sisters Elsa and Anna. When Elsa loses control of her ice power
 s the kingdom is plunged into eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embar
 ks on a journey with Kristoff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and hea
 l the kingdom.</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srjc.univ
 ersitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=37" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 >Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets.</a></p>
