X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar Livewhale": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23554-beautiful-trash-exhibit"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTSTAMP:20260820T143514Z
UID:20261125T080000Z-23554@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261125
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,846,846/684_Beautiful_Trash_SRJC_Art_Exhibit_2.rev.1
 787262058.png
CATEGORIES:Arts,Department Events
DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six student
 s who participated in a seven-week art residency program.  The students se
 lected trash from Recology's Materials Recovery Facility and created art t
 hat inspires reflection on our habits with waste.  TRASH (The Recology Art
 start Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Marin and Ar
 tstart.  This event is an SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonom
 a Marin and Artstart.  &#160\;For more information about the Herold Mahone
 y Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https://libraries.santarosa
 .edu/mahoney_gallery)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T215728Z
LOCATION:Herold Mahoney Library Gallery - Petaluma Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23554-beautiful-trash-exhibit
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features art
 works from six students who participated in a seven-week art residency pro
 gram.</p><p>  The students selected trash from Recology's Materials Recove
 ry Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits with wa
 ste.</p><p>  TRASH (The Recology Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration 
 between Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  This event is an SRJC 
 Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  &
 #160\;</p><p><a href="https://libraries.santarosa.edu/mahoney_gallery" tar
 get="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about the Herold Mahoney 
 Library Gallery\, visit their website here.</a></p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ALL-DAY:1
