X-SOURCE-ID:sonoma_county_gov
SUMMARY:Design Review Committee Meeting
DTSTART:20261202T133000
DTEND:20261202T133000
UID:f0fd88de196341cd73a8ceed917c1579@sonomacounty.gov
DESCRIPTION:The Design Review Committee (DRC) reviews and approves the des
 ign of significant new development projects\, such as new commercial devel
 opment. The Committee considers building and site design\, architecture\, 
 colors\, lighting\, signs\, landscaping and other design-related issues.
